    <template v-else><div v-if="qrCode && !configured" class="two-factor-setup my-6 grid min-w-0 gap-4"><div class="qr-box mx-auto w-fit max-w-full rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-white p-4 [&_svg]:h-auto [&_svg]:max-w-full" role="img" aria-label="QR code para configurar o autenticador" v-html="qrCode" /><p class="field-hint text-sm leading-5 text-td-body">Escaneie o QR code no seu aplicativo. Se preferir, use a chave manual:</p><code class="manual-key block max-w-full break-all rounded-lg bg-td-soft p-4 text-center text-sm tracking-wide text-td-ink">{{ manualKey || 'Chave não informada' }}</code><button class="btn-secondary mt-3 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm text-td-ink hover:bg-td-soft focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-td-primary" type="button" @click="copyManualKey">{{ copyKeyState === 'copied' ? 'Chave copiada' : 'Copiar chave manual' }}</button><p v-if="copyKeyState === 'copied'" class="form-help mt-2 text-sm leading-5 text-td-body" role="status" aria-live="polite">Chave copiada.</p><p v-else-if="copyKeyState === 'error'" class="field-error mt-2 text-sm leading-5 text-td-red" role="alert">Não foi possível copiar automaticamente. Selecione e copie a chave manual.</p></div><form v-if="!configured" class="auth-form mt-6 grid min-w-0 grid-cols-12 gap-6 [&>*]:col-span-12" @submit.prevent="confirm"><div class="field-group grid min-w-0 content-start gap-3"><label class="field-label block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400" for="two-factor-code">Código de confirmação</label><input id="two-factor-code" v-model="confirmForm.code" class="form-input w-full min-w-0 scroll-mt-28 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-transparent px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 text-td-ink outline-none placeholder:text-td-body/70 focus:border-td-primary focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-td-primary/15 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-td-soft disabled:text-td-body file:mr-3 file:rounded file:border-0 file:bg-td-soft file:px-3 file:py-1 file:text-sm file:text-td-primary" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="6" placeholder="000000" required :aria-invalid="Boolean(confirmForm.errors.code)" /><p v-if="confirmForm.errors.code" class="field-error text-sm leading-5 text-td-red" role="alert">{{ confirmForm.errors.code }}</p></div><div class="form-actions mt-6 grid gap-3"><button class="btn-primary inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-td-primary bg-td-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 text-white hover:bg-td-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-td-primary disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:size-5 [&_svg]:shrink-0" type="submit" :disabled="confirmForm.processing" :aria-busy="confirmForm.processing"><ShieldCheckIcon aria-hidden="true" /><span>{{ confirmForm.processing ? 'Confirmando…' : 'Ativar segundo fator' }}</span></button></div></form></template>
    <section v-if="recoveryCodes.length" class="recovery-codes my-6 grid min-w-0 gap-4 border-y border-td-border py-6 [&_h3]:flex [&_h3]:items-center [&_h3]:gap-2 [&_h3]:text-lg [&_h3]:font-medium [&_h3]:text-td-ink [&_svg]:size-5 [&_p]:text-sm [&_p]:leading-6" aria-labelledby="recovery-title"><h3 id="recovery-title"><KeyIcon aria-hidden="true" /> Seus códigos de recuperação</h3><p>Copie ou baixe os códigos e confirme que os salvou antes de continuar. Eles são exibidos somente após uma operação autorizada.</p><div class="codes-grid grid min-w-0 gap-2 min-[400px]:grid-cols-2 [&_code]:break-all [&_code]:rounded [&_code]:bg-td-soft [&_code]:p-3 [&_code]:text-sm [&_code]:text-td-ink"><code v-for="code in recoveryCodes" :key="code">{{ code }}</code></div><div class="recovery-actions flex flex-wrap gap-3 [&>button]:flex-1"><button class="btn-secondary inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 text-td-ink hover:bg-td-soft focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-td-primary disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:size-5 [&_svg]:shrink-0" type="button" @click="copyRecoveryCodes"><ClipboardDocumentIcon aria-hidden="true" /> {{ copyState === 'copied' ? 'Copiados' : 'Copiar códigos' }}</button><button class="btn-secondary inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 text-td-ink hover:bg-td-soft focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-td-primary disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:size-5 [&_svg]:shrink-0" type="button" @click="downloadRecoveryCodes"><ArrowDownTrayIcon aria-hidden="true" /> Baixar arquivo</button></div><p v-if="copyState === 'copied'" class="status-message recovery-save-status my-5 flex min-w-0 items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-td-green/25 bg-td-green/5 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-td-green-ink [&_svg]:size-5 [&_svg]:shrink-0 my-0" role="status" aria-live="polite">Códigos copiados. Confirme quando estiverem salvos.</p><p v-if="copyState === 'error'" class="field-error text-sm leading-5 text-td-red" role="alert">Não foi possível copiar automaticamente. Use o botão de baixar.</p><label class="checkbox-row recovery-confirm flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-td-body [&_input]:mt-1 [&_input]:size-4 [&_input]:shrink-0 [&_input]:accent-td-primary mt-4"><input v-model="recoveryCodesSaved" type="checkbox" /> <span>Confirmei que salvei meus códigos em local seguro.</span></label></section>
    <form v-if="configured" class="panel stack min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-white p-6 shadow-td-card sm:p-8 [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:font-medium [&_h2]:leading-7 [&_h2]:text-td-ink [&_h3]:font-medium [&_h3]:text-td-ink [&_dd]:break-words grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 [&>*]:col-span-12" @submit.prevent="regenerate"><div class="panel-heading mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 [&_p]:mt-2 [&_p]:text-sm [&_p]:leading-6 [&_p]:text-td-body"><div><h2>Gerar novos códigos</h2><p>Informe sua senha atual e um código TOTP ou código de recuperação anterior.</p></div></div><div class="field-group grid min-w-0 content-start gap-3"><label class="field-label block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400" for="recovery-current-password">Senha atual</label><input id="recovery-current-password" v-model="recoveryForm.current_password" class="form-input w-full min-w-0 scroll-mt-28 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-transparent px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 text-td-ink outline-none placeholder:text-td-body/70 focus:border-td-primary focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-td-primary/15 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-td-soft disabled:text-td-body file:mr-3 file:rounded file:border-0 file:bg-td-soft file:px-3 file:py-1 file:text-sm file:text-td-primary" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required :aria-invalid="Boolean(recoveryForm.errors.current_password)" placeholder="Digite sua senha atual" /><p v-if="recoveryForm.errors.current_password" class="field-error text-sm leading-5 text-td-red" role="alert">{{ recoveryForm.errors.current_password }}</p></div><div class="field-group grid min-w-0 content-start gap-3"><label class="field-label block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400" for="recovery-previous-code">Código TOTP ou código de recuperação anterior</label><input id="recovery-previous-code" v-model="recoveryForm.code" class="form-input w-full min-w-0 scroll-mt-28 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-transparent px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 text-td-ink outline-none placeholder:text-td-body/70 focus:border-td-primary focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-td-primary/15 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-td-soft disabled:text-td-body file:mr-3 file:rounded file:border-0 file:bg-td-soft file:px-3 file:py-1 file:text-sm file:text-td-primary" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="64" required :aria-invalid="Boolean(recoveryForm.errors.code)" placeholder="000000 ou código de recuperação" /><p v-if="recoveryForm.errors.code" class="field-error text-sm leading-5 text-td-red" role="alert">{{ recoveryForm.errors.code }}</p></div><div class="form-actions mt-6 grid gap-3"><button class="btn-secondary inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-td-border bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 text-td-ink hover:bg-td-soft focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-td-primary disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:size-5 [&_svg]:shrink-0" type="submit" :disabled="recoveryForm.processing" :aria-busy="recoveryForm.processing"><KeyIcon aria-hidden="true" /> {{ recoveryForm.processing ? 'Gerando…' : 'Gerar novos códigos' }}</button></div></form>
    <div v-if="canGoDashboard" class="link-row mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm"><Link class="text-link inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded text-td-primary hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-td-primary" href="/dashboard">Ir para o dashboard</Link></div>
  </AuthShell>
